{"candidateAnswer":"Stay involved in sports in some kind of leadership role","evidence":"[D11:19 | 8:17 pm on 21 September, 2023] John: I've thought about it a lot. I want to use my platform to make a positive difference and inspire others - maybe even start a foundation and do charity work. It's important to me to make the most of the chances I get and leave a meaningful legacy.\n[D26:1 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] John: Hey Tim! Great to hear from you. My week's been busy - I started doing seminars, helping people with their sports and marketing. It's been awesome!\n[D27:26 | 5:26 pm on 2 January, 2024] John: He's a great leader and puts others first - that's why he eventually becomes king.","itemId":"urn:uuid:0957216b-1b78-5cad-9ac7-31afd1e08dbe","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0ca1c7218bc9fc7658fe5684f0f23f524d9443952c3c6cf93464d2892ce61121","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What could John do after his basketball career?","referenceAnswer":"become a basketball coach since he likes giving back and leadership","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0ca1c7218bc9fc7658fe5684f0f23f524d9443952c3c6cf93464d2892ce61121"}}]}